      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUN THE GAUNTLET (1) was out of placings last time (30.53) at Addington in a Invitations, finishing fourth and beaten 4.5 lengths. Has two wins already from this draw. With a clean break looks hard to beat. BARTLETT (4) tends to drift back and work into the race, finishing out of the placings two back before charging home into the minors latest when third (34.82) in a Grade 4/5 at Q Parklands last time. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Leading player again. BANDIT BAY (7) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Q Parklands over 600m behind Crystal Days (35.13) in a Restricted WIN. Was in the money the start prior. Shapes as one to consider. ADA TANGO (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
